### Task B – review and fix this REST request.
###
### It is meant to run a SuiteQL query against the SANDBOX account with ID 1234567_SB1.
### The integration uses token-based authentication (OAuth 1.0, HMAC-SHA256).
###
### 1. Find every problem and fix the request.
### 2. For each credential / value, add a comment saying where it comes from.
### 3. Never put real credentials in this file; use placeholders.
###
### (The file uses the format of the VS Code "REST Client" extension, but it is
### plain text: you do not need to run it.)

GET https://1234567.suitetalk.api.netsuite.com/services/rest/query/v1/suiteql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
